    "Maintained harness identity propagation and full session resource completeness, judge overhead/net-cost reporting and mixed reload validation.",
    "Post-adoption monitoring, reusable experiment revisions, explicit renewal of exhausted judge jobs, TUI candidate creation and complete assessment-revision history.",
    "Full isolated capture-to-publication acceptance and actual interactive-terminal acceptance beyond action-port and state-machine tests."
